dependencies.description:
Dependencies in npm's package.json format (name -> version).
The system will automatically include @airtable/blocks, react, react-dom, and tailwindcss.
Example: {"@google/model-viewer": "4.3.1", "howler": "beta"}

filters.description:
Filters limiting the records exposed from this table to the custom element. For
the primary table, this filter is applied in addition to the page's record scope filters.
Omit to leave filters unchanged; pass null to clear them.
